What it does not cover:
- The game itself: no game files are included, and WWE 2K14 belongs to its owners. The recompiled game code in
  wwe2k14.exe is generated from your own copy and is not ours to license.
- The WWE 2K14 logo and the icon art: trademarks and artwork of their owners (the icon is fan-made art from
  SteamGridDB).
- Third-party libraries keep their own licences: see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. The files in the nvidia folder are
  NVIDIA's, under NVIDIA's licences (nvidia\nvngx_dlss.license.txt, nvidia\streamline.license.txt); the Visual C++
  runtime DLLs are Microsoft's redistributable files.

